{"unit_id":"PerryLink__dsh-mask#card-zh","repo":"PerryLink/dsh-mask","commit":"11402b9b71cda30233934b8f77aaca776dbe185d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mask 是面向 DeepSeek Harness 的主机端个人数据遮罩插件，在 agent/pre-step 模型边界将配置的电话、邮箱、身份证、银行卡、密钥及可选 IP 替换为占位符，并维护按会话累计的还原映射。可选配置 tools 作用域遮罩工具结果；/mask 提供状态、运行时开关和显式还原，mask_test 可试跑文本。映射可持久化到 storageDomain，也可仅保存在内存；还原内容写入本机文件。适合希望减少个人数据进入模型上下文的 DSH 用户。默认仅遮罩消息；姓名和地址识别及浏览器界面自动还原未实现。无需 API key 或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:361-416","index.mjs:450-515","lib/store.mjs:1-14","lib/deliver.mjs:81-110"]}
{"unit_id":"PerryLink__dsh-mask#card-en","repo":"PerryLink/dsh-mask","commit":"11402b9b71cda30233934b8f77aaca776dbe185d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-mask replaces personal data in DSH messages with placeholders. A tools scope can mask results. /mask controls status, runtime toggles, and restore; mask_test previews masking. Mappings may persist via storageDomain; restored text goes to a local file. No API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:361-416","index.mjs:450-515","lib/store.mjs:1-14","lib/deliver.mjs:81-110"]}
