{"unit_id":"PerryLink__dsh-mask#feature-1","repo":"PerryLink/dsh-mask","commit":"11402b9b71cda30233934b8f77aaca776dbe185d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mask 的功能「请求消息遮罩」：在 agent/pre-step 处理文本消息中的配置实体，并将替换后的消息交给模型流程。默认作用域为 messages。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:361-385","lib/mask.mjs:10-44"]}
{"unit_id":"PerryLink__dsh-mask#feature-2","repo":"PerryLink/dsh-mask","commit":"11402b9b71cda30233934b8f77aaca776dbe185d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mask 的功能「工具结果遮罩」：配置 scope 为 tools 时，在 tools/post-execute 替换结果文本块中的匹配内容；其他内容块保持原样。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:389-416","lib/mask.mjs:53-70"]}
{"unit_id":"PerryLink__dsh-mask#feature-3","repo":"PerryLink/dsh-mask","commit":"11402b9b71cda30233934b8f77aaca776dbe185d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mask 的功能「/mask 控制」：/mask status 查看启用状态、累计替换数和类型分布；/mask on 与 /mask off 控制当前运行时的遮罩开关。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:229-236","index.mjs:450-470"]}
{"unit_id":"PerryLink__dsh-mask#feature-4","repo":"PerryLink/dsh-mask","commit":"11402b9b71cda30233934b8f77aaca776dbe185d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mask 的功能「占位符还原」：使用 /mask restore 加上当前会话文本，恢复已知占位符，并把还原内容写入文件，命令结果返回文件路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:472-498","lib/deliver.mjs:81-110"]}
{"unit_id":"PerryLink__dsh-mask#feature-5","repo":"PerryLink/dsh-mask","commit":"11402b9b71cda30233934b8f77aaca776dbe185d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mask 的功能「mask_test 试跑」：工具接收一段文本，返回替换后的文本、替换数量与实体类型分布，便于预览检测结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:253-308"]}
{"unit_id":"PerryLink__dsh-mask#caveat-1","repo":"PerryLink/dsh-mask","commit":"11402b9b71cda30233934b8f77aaca776dbe185d","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"使用前须知：默认不遮罩 IP；电话和身份证规则仅匹配中国大陆格式，姓名与地址识别未实现。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/constants.mjs:17-29","index.mjs:132-170"]}
